
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>EE Fieldnotes — Electrical Engineering, Made Visual</title>

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Learn electrical engineering through visual explanations, interactive experiments, and guided waveform explorations."
  >

  <style>
    /* =========================
       1. DESIGN SYSTEM
    ========================= */

    :root {
      --blue: #3568c0;
      --blue-dark: #244d96;
      --blue-light: #eaf1fc;

      --background: #ffffff;
      --surface: #f7f8fa;
      --border: #e7e9ee;

      --text: #20242b;
      --muted: #747b88;

      --radius: 16px;
      --container: 1120px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--background);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    button,
    input {
      font: inherit;
    }

    button {
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(var(--container), calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 88px 0;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--blue);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .section-heading {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
      margin: 12px 0;
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px);
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -1.4px;
    }

    .section-heading p {
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 570px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* =========================
       2. NAVIGATION
    ========================= */

    .navbar {
      height: 76px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
    }

    .nav-inner {
      height: 100%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 11px;
      font-weight: 750;
      font-size: 18px;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: white;
      background: var(--blue);
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 19px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 28px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: var(--blue);
    }

    .nav-cta {
      padding: 10px 16px;
      background: var(--blue);
      color: white;
      border-radius: 9px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .nav-cta:hover {
      background: var(--blue-dark);
    }

    /* =========================
       3. HERO
    ========================= */

    .hero {
      padding: 82px 0 72px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.95fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 64px;
    }

    .hero-copy h1 {
      max-width: 610px;
      margin: 18px 0;
      font-size: clamp(38px, 5.5vw, 66px);
      line-height: 1.08;
      letter-spacing: -3px;
    }

    .hero-copy h1 span {
      color: var(--blue);
    }

    .hero-copy > p {
      max-width: 500px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 28px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      min-height: 46px;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: white;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 650;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .button-primary {
      color: white;
      background: var(--blue);
      border-color: var(--blue);
    }

    .button-primary:hover {
      background: var(--blue-dark);
      border-color: var(--blue-dark);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .button-secondary:hover {
      border-color: var(--blue);
      color: var(--blue);
    }

    .hero-note {
      margin-top: 22px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    /* =========================
       4. WAVEFORM EXPLORER
    ========================= */

    .demo-card {
      position: relative;
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: white;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 60px rgba(28, 52, 91, 0.07);
    }

    .demo-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .demo-title {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .demo-label {
      color: var(--blue);
      background: var(--blue-light);
      padding: 5px 9px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 750;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .wave-container {
      padding: 8px 0;
      background: #f8faff;
      border: 1px solid #edf2fa;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    #waveform {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
    }

    .wave-grid {
      stroke: #e4eaf4;
      stroke-width: 1;
    }

    .wave-axis {
      stroke: #aab7ca;
      stroke-width: 1.2;
    }

    .wave-line {
      fill: none;
      stroke: var(--blue);
      stroke-width: 2.8;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
    }

    .wave-input {
      fill: none;
      stroke: #aab5c5;
      stroke-width: 1.5;
      stroke-dasharray: 4 5;
    }

    .wave-angle {
      stroke: #d97835;
      stroke-width: 1.5;
      stroke-dasharray: 3 3;
    }

    .demo-legend {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
      margin: 14px 0 22px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .legend-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
    }

    .legend-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--blue);
    }

    .legend-dot.input {
      background: #aab5c5;
    }

    .legend-dot.angle {
      background: #d97835;
    }

    .control-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 9px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .control-value {
      color: var(--blue);
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    input[type="range"] {
      width: 100%;
      accent-color: var(--blue);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .range-labels {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-top: 4px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .demo-controls {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      margin-top: 22px;
    }

    .demo-controls button {
      min-height: 38px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: white;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .demo-controls button:hover {
      border-color: var(--blue);
      color: var(--blue);
    }

    .demo-controls .play-button {
      color: white;
      background: var(--blue);
      border-color: var(--blue);
    }

    .demo-controls .play-button:hover {
      color: white;
      background: var(--blue-dark);
    }

    .step-info {
      min-height: 48px;
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 12px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border-radius: 9px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .step-info strong {
      color: var(--text);
    }

    /* =========================
       5. MODULES
    ========================= */

    .modules-section {
      background: var(--surface);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .module-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .module-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: white;
      transition:
        transform 0.2s ease,
        border-color 0.2s ease,
        box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }

    .module-card.available {
      border-color: #cbdaf1;
    }

    .module-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: #b7cbea;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(28, 52, 91, 0.06);
    }

    .module-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .module-number {
      color: var(--blue);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 750;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .status {
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: #f0f1f4;
      color: #747b88;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .status.available {
      background: var(--blue-light);
      color: var(--blue);
    }

    .module-art {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      height: 125px;
      margin: 18px 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 11px;
      background: #f5f8fd;
    }

    .module-art svg {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
    }

    .module-card h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    }

    .module-card p {
      margin: 10px 0 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .module-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-top: auto;
      color: var(--blue);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .module-link.disabled {
      color: #9aa0aa;
      cursor: default;
    }

    /* =========================
       6. LEARNING FEATURES
    ========================= */

    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .feature {
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }

    .feature-icon {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border-radius: 11px;
      background: var(--blue-light);
      color: var(--blue);
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .feature h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .feature p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    /* =========================
       7. FOOTER
    ========================= */

    footer {
      padding: 32px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .footer-inner p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .footer-brand {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    /* =========================
       8. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    ========================= */

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 42px;
      }

      .hero-copy {
        max-width: 700px;
      }

      .demo-card {
        max-width: 650px;
      }

      .module-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      .features-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .container {
        width: calc(100% - 32px);
      }

      .section {
        padding: 62px 0;
      }

      .navbar {
        height: 66px;
      }

      .nav-links {
        gap: 14px;
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      .nav-links .nav-cta {
        padding: 8px 10px;
      }

      .brand {
        font-size: 15px;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .brand-mark {
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 58px 0;
      }

      .hero-copy h1 {
        letter-spacing: -1.8px;
      }

      .hero-copy > p {
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .demo-card {
        padding: 17px;
      }

      .module-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .module-art {
        height: 145px;
      }

      .footer-inner {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <!-- =========================
       NAVIGATION
  ========================= -->

  <header class="navbar">
    <div class="container nav-inner">

      <a href="#" class="brand">
        <span class="brand-mark">∿</span>
        <span>EE Fieldnotes</span>
      </a>

      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#modules">Modules</a>
        <a href="#learning">About</a>
        <a href="#modules" class="nav-cta">Start learning ↗</a>
      </nav>

    </div>
  </header>


  <main>

    <!-- =========================
         HERO
    ========================= -->

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">

        <div class="hero-copy">

          <div class="eyebrow">
            Electrical engineering · Visual learning
          </div>

          <h1>
            Understand the circuit.<br>
            See the <span>waveform.</span>
          </h1>

          <p>
            Electrical engineering, explained visually.
            Explore circuits, experiment with parameters, and
            understand the ideas behind the equations.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="#modules" class="button button-primary">
              Explore modules →
            </a>

            <a href="#experiment" class="button button-secondary">
              Try an experiment
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-note">
            An independent student learning project · Advanced Power Electronics
          </div>

        </div>


        <!-- INTERACTIVE DEMO -->

        <div class="demo-card" id="experiment">

          <div class="demo-header">
            <div class="demo-title">
              Waveform explorer
            </div>

            <div class="demo-label">
              INTERACTIVE
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="wave-container">

            <svg
              id="waveform"
              viewBox="0 0 340 180"
              role="img"
              aria-label="Illustrative controlled rectifier output waveform"
            >

              <g class="wave-grid">
                <line x1="30" y1="20" x2="30" y2="155"/>
                <line x1="100" y1="20" x2="100" y2="155"/>
                <line x1="170" y1="20" x2="170" y2="155"/>
                <line x1="240" y1="20" x2="240" y2="155"/>
                <line x1="310" y1="20" x2="310" y2="155"/>

                <line x1="20" y1="40" x2="320" y2="40"/>
                <line x1="20" y1="90" x2="320" y2="90"/>
                <line x1="20" y1="140" x2="320" y2="140"/>
              </g>

              <line
                class="wave-axis"
                x1="20"
                y1="90"
                x2="320"
                y2="90"
              />

              <path
                id="inputWave"
                class="wave-input"
                d=""
              />

              <path
                id="outputWave"
                class="wave-line"
                d=""
              />

              <line
                id="angleMarker"
                class="wave-angle"
                x1="20"
                y1="20"
                x2="20"
                y2="155"
              />

              <text
                id="angleText"
                x="25"
                y="15"
                font-size="10"
                fill="#d97835"
              >
                α
              </text>

              <text
                x="315"
                y="170"
                font-size="10"
                fill="#7b8798"
              >
                ωt
              </text>

            </svg>

          </div>


          <div class="demo-legend">

            <div class="legend-item">
              <span class="legend-dot input"></span>
              Input voltage
            </div>

            <div class="legend-item">
              <span class="legend-dot"></span>
              Output illustration
            </div>

            <div class="legend-item">
              <span class="legend-dot angle"></span>
              Firing angle
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="control-row">

            <label for="angleSlider">
              Firing angle α
            </label>

            <output
              id="angleValue"
              class="control-value"
              for="angleSlider"
            >
              60°
            </output>

          </div>

          <input
            type="range"
            id="angleSlider"
    min="0"
    max="150"
    value="60"
    step="5"
    aria-label="Adjust firing angle"
          >

          <div class="range-labels">
            <span>0°</span>
            <span>75°</span>
            <span>150°</span>
          </div>


          <div class="demo-controls">

            <button
              id="previousStep"
              type="button"
            >
              ← Previous
            </button>

            <button
              id="playButton"
              class="play-button"
              type="button"
            >
              ▶ Play
            </button>

            <button
              id="nextStep"
              type="button"
            >
              Next →
            </button>

          </div>


          <div
            id="stepInfo"
            class="step-info"
            aria-live="polite"
          >
            <strong>Step 1:</strong>
            Observe the input voltage before conduction begins.
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- =========================
         MODULES
    ========================= -->

    <section class="section modules-section" id="modules">

      <div class="container">

        <div class="section-heading">

          <div class="eyebrow">
            The learning path
          </div>

          <h2>
            Explore Advanced Power Electronics
          </h2>

          <p>
            From PWM rectifiers to active power filters,
            explore the concepts that shape modern power
            conversion through visual explanations.
          </p>

        </div>


        <div class="module-grid">


          <!-- MODULE 1 -->

          <article class="module-card available">

            <div class="module-top">
              <span class="module-number">MODULE 01</span>
              <span class="status available">In progress</span>
            </div>

            <div class="module-art">

              <svg viewBox="0 0 300 130" aria-hidden="true">

                <g stroke="#dce5f2" stroke-width="1">
                  <line x1="20" y1="30" x2="280" y2="30"/>
                  <line x1="20" y1="65" x2="280" y2="65"/>
                  <line x1="20" y1="100" x2="280" y2="100"/>
                </g>

                <path
                  d="M20 65 Q55 10 90 65 T160 65 T230 65 T280 65"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="#a9b6c9"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  stroke-dasharray="4 4"
                />

                <path
                  d="M20 65 L55 65 Q75 25 90 25 L90 65 L125 65 Q145 105 160 105 L160 65 L195 65 Q215 25 230 25 L230 65 L265 65"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="#3568c0"
                  stroke-width="2.5"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                />

              </svg>

            </div>

            <h3>PWM Rectifiers & Space Vector PWM</h3>

            <p>
              Explore rectifier operation, pulse-width modulation,
              and space-vector switching.
            </p>

            <a href="#experiment" class="module-link">
              Explore module →
            </a>

          </article>


          <!-- MODULE 2 -->

          <article class="module-card">

            <div class="module-top">
              <span class="module-number">MODULE 02</span>
              <span class="status">Coming soon</span>
            </div>

            <div class="module-art">

              <svg viewBox="0 0 300 130" aria-hidden="true">

                <g stroke="#dce5f2" stroke-width="1">
                  <line x1="20" y1="30" x2="280" y2="30"/>
                  <line x1="20" y1="65" x2="280" y2="65"/>
                  <line x1="20" y1="100" x2="280" y2="100"/>
                </g>

                <path
                  d="M20 100 H60 V65 H110 V30 H160 V65 H210 V100 H260"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="#3568c0"
                  stroke-width="3"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                />

              </svg>

            </div>

            <h3>Multilevel Inverters</h3>

            <p>
              Discover inverter topologies and how multilevel
              voltage waveforms are formed.
            </p>

            <span class="module-link disabled">
              Coming soon
            </span>

          </article>


          <!-- MODULE 3 -->

          <article class="module-card">

            <div class="module-top">
              <span class="module-number">MODULE 03</span>
              <span class="status">Coming soon</span>
            </div>

            <div class="module-art">

              <svg viewBox="0 0 300 130" aria-hidden="true">

                <g stroke="#dce5f2" stroke-width="1">
                  <line x1="20" y1="30" x2="280" y2="30"/>
                  <line x1="20" y1="65" x2="280" y2="65"/>
                  <line x1="20" y1="100" x2="280" y2="100"/>
                </g>

                <path
                  d="M20 65
                     C35 15 50 15 65 65
                     S95 115 110 65
                     S140 15 155 65
                     S185 115 200 65
                     S230 15 245 65
                     S275 115 280 65"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="#3568c0"
                  stroke-width="2.5"
                />

              </svg>

            </div>

            <h3>Soft Switching & Resonant Converters</h3>

            <p>
              Understand resonant operation and switching
              techniques that reduce switching losses.
            </p>

            <span class="module-link disabled">
              Coming soon
            </span>

          </article>


          <!-- MODULE 4 -->

          <article class="module-card">

            <div class="module-top">
              <span class="module-number">MODULE 04</span>
              <span class="status">Coming soon</span>
            </div>

            <div class="module-art">

              <svg viewBox="0 0 300 130" aria-hidden="true">

                <g
                  stroke="#3568c0"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  fill="none"
